{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01305",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.05,
      "end_seconds": 5.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. Lovely to to meet you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.03,
      "end_seconds": 12.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "Of course, leave it it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.31,
      "end_seconds": 19.36,
      "duration_seconds": 6.05,
      "text": "So, I've been dealing with a mole that has got bigger."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.94,
      "end_seconds": 21.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.62,
      "end_seconds": 28.91,
      "duration_seconds": 6.29,
      "text": "I've, I've had it for about two weeks. And a darker edge, too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.55,
      "end_seconds": 46.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any crusting, bleeding or other new moles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.08,
      "end_seconds": 52.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.61,
      "end_seconds": 57.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "right, how are your bowels, any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.31,
      "end_seconds": 61.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "No, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.95,
      "end_seconds": 70.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.43,
      "end_seconds": 76.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "my heart's been fine, as far as I know"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.99,
      "end_seconds": 80.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.43,
      "end_seconds": 83.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "No allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.87,
      "end_seconds": 86.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.03,
      "end_seconds": 89.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.93,
      "end_seconds": 95.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Okay, what do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.09,
      "end_seconds": 99.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.17,
      "end_seconds": 104.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.41,
      "end_seconds": 109.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "I've had gout for nearly five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.24,
      "end_seconds": 113.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.22,
      "end_seconds": 121.57,
      "duration_seconds": 5.35,
      "text": "It's febuxostat, 80 milligrams, once a day for the gout."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.23,
      "end_seconds": 142.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.61,
      "end_seconds": 152.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "nearly done with the readings.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.72,
      "end_seconds": 176.26,
      "duration_seconds": 14.54,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 116 over 69, BMI works out to 21.1, SpO2 98 percent on room air, pulse is 69 beats a minute, height 181 centimetres, weight 69 kilos."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.21,
      "end_seconds": 183.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Is that that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.58,
      "end_seconds": 186.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "That's fine, I'll explain it soon."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.45,
      "end_seconds": 193.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.63,
      "end_seconds": 195.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.91,
      "end_seconds": 216.33,
      "duration_seconds": 6.42,
      "text": "the mole is seven millimetres with an irregular border and two shades of brown"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.52,
      "end_seconds": 224.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "right, that's all I needed to check"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.26,
      "end_seconds": 254.81,
      "duration_seconds": 17.55,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, this looks most like a mole with features that need specialist assessment. I want to be honest that that this is an impression, not a final answer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.16,
      "end_seconds": 258.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.04,
      "end_seconds": 269.48,
      "duration_seconds": 9.44,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a mole with features that need specialist assessment do well once it's treated properly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.77,
      "end_seconds": 300.65,
      "duration_seconds": 12.88,
      "text": "A skin biopsy is what I'd like next, for changing mole. Protect it from the sun until you are seen. Let's review you after the biopsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.13,
      "end_seconds": 304.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Alright, I'll be back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.12,
      "end_seconds": 310.19,
      "duration_seconds": 5.07,
      "text": "Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 311.46,
      "end_seconds": 313.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor, goodbye."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.12,
      "end_seconds": 316.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Okay, take care now."
    }
  ]
}